{"suttaId":"sn14.21","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[785,786],"vripara":"105"},"segments":{"sn14.21:0.3":"Appassutamūlakasuttaṃ","sn14.21:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … pe …“dhātusova, bhikkhave, sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.21:1.3":"Appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:1.4":"kusītā kusītehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:1.5":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:1.6":"bahussutā bahussutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:1.7":"āraddhavīriyā āraddhavīriyehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti … pe ….(1)","sn14.21:2.1":"“Appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:2.2":"muṭṭhassatino muṭṭhassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:2.3":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:2.4":"bahussutā bahussutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.21:2.5":"upaṭṭhitassatino upaṭṭhitassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samentīti … pe ….","sn14.21:2.6":"Ekādasamaṃ.(2)"},"attha":{"book":"Spk-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0302a.att","from":556,"to":559,"paras":[{"para":556,"vripara":"102-106","refs":["sn14.21:1"],"lines":["102-106. Aṭṭhamādīni teyeva assaddhādidhamme tikavasena katvā desitāni.","Tattha aṭṭhame assaddhādimūlakā kaṇhapakkhasukkapakkhavasena pañca tikā vuttā, navame ahirikamūlakā cattāro.","Dasame anottappamūlakā tayo, ekādasame appassutamūlakā dve, dvādasame kusītamūlako eko tiko vuttoti sabbepi pañcasu suttantesu pannarasa tikā honti.","Pannarasa cete suttantātipi vadanti.","Ayaṃ tikapeyyālo nāma.","Aṭṭhamādīni."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"]]},{"para":557,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dutiyo vaggo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":558,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kammapathavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":559,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.21:1"],"lines":["1-2. Asamāhitasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn14.21:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0302t.tik","from":560,"to":564,"paras":[{"para":560,"vripara":"102-106","refs":["sn14.21:1"],"lines":["102-106. <b>Aṭṭhamādīnī</b>ti aṭṭhamaṃ navamaṃ dasamaṃ ekādasamaṃ dvādasamanti imāni pañca suttānīti eke.","Apare pana nava suttānīti icchanti.","Svāyamattho aṭṭhakathāyaṃ vuttoyeva.","Pāḷiyañca kesuci potthakesu likhīyati."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"],["sn14.21:1"]]},{"para":561,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Assaddhamūlakasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":562,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dutiyavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":563,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kammapathavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":564,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.21:1"],"lines":["1-2. Asamāhitasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn14.21:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
